<title>USA: Alumax says Hueck acquisition talks ended.</title>
<headline>Alumax says Hueck acquisition talks ended.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alumax Inc said Wednesday that acquisition talks with Eduard Hueck GmbH &amp; Co KG were ended by mutual agreement.</p>
<p>Hueck, based in Ludenscheid, Germany, manufactures aluminum architectural products.</p>
<p>Alumax officials were not immediately available for comment.  </p>
<p>An Alumax spokesman, Dan Loh, said later Wednesday that the companies ended the talks because they were unable to reach agreement on several, unspecified issues.</p>
</text>
